<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Sonia J. LeBron, SPHR — Private Family Office & Chief of Staff</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,300;1,400&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  :root {
    --gold: #B8985A;
    --gold-light: #D4B87A;
    --gold-pale: #F5EDD8;
    --navy: #0D1B2A;
    --navy-mid: #1A2E42;
    --cream: #FAF8F3;
    --text: #1A1A18;
    --muted: #6B6559;
    --border: rgba(184,152,90,0.25);
  }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
    background: var(--cream);
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.7;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }
  nav {
    position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 1.5rem 4rem;
    background: rgba(250,248,243,0.92);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border);
  }
  .nav-logo {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--navy);
  }
  .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2.5rem; }
  .nav-links a {
    font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none; color: var(--muted); transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--gold); }
  .nav-cta {
    font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none; color: var(--navy);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--gold);
    padding: 0.6rem 1.4rem;
    transition: all 0.25s;
  }
  .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--gold); color: #fff; }

  /* HERO */
  .hero { min-height: 100vh; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; padding-top: 5rem; }
  .hero-left { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; padding: 6rem 4rem 6rem 6rem; position: relative; }
  .hero-left::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; right: 0; width: 0.5px; height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, var(--gold), transparent); }
  .hero-tag { font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 1.8rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; }
  .hero-tag::before { content: ''; display: block; width: 40px; height: 0.5px; background: var(--gold); }
  h1 { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.8rem); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.1; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
  h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--gold); }
  .hero-subtitle { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 300; font-style: italic; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 2.5rem; letter-spacing: 0.03em; }
  .hero-desc { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 440px; margin-bottom: 2rem; line-height: 1.85; }
  
  .btn-primary { 
    display: inline-block; 
    text-decoration: none; 
    background: var(--navy); 
    color: var(--cream); 
    padding: 1.1rem 2.6rem; 
    font-size: 0.72rem; 
    letter-spacing: 0.18em; 
    text-transform: uppercase; 
    transition: all 0.25s; 
    border: none;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--gold); color: #fff; }

  .hero-right { position: relative; overflow: hidden; min-height: 600px; background: #eee; }
  .hero-right img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: top center; display: block; }

  /* SECTION */
  section { padding: 7rem 6rem; }
  .section-tag { font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 1rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.8rem; }
  .section-tag::before { content: ''; display: block; width: 30px; height: 0.5px; background: var(--gold); }
  h2 { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem); font-weight: 300; color: var(--navy); line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  h2 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--gold); }

  .inquiry-section { background: var(--cream); text-align: center; }

  footer { background: var(--navy); color: rgba(250,248,243,0.4); padding: 3rem 6rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.72rem; }
  
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    nav { padding: 1.2rem 2rem; }
    .nav-links { display: none; }
    section { padding: 5rem 2.5rem; }
    .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero-left { padding: 8rem 2.5rem 4rem; }
    footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="nav-logo">Sonia J. LeBron</div>
  <div class="nav-links">
    <a href="#inquiry">Contact</a>
  </div>
  <a href="#inquiry" class="nav-cta">Private Inquiry</a>
</nav>

<section class="hero" style="padding: 0;">
  <div class="hero-left">
    <div class="hero-tag">Private Family Office &amp; Household Leadership</div>
    <h1>Trusted by<br><em>Extraordinary</em><br>Families.</h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">Chief of Staff · Human Capital Strategist · SPHR</p>
    <p class="hero-desc">For over two decades, Sonia J. LeBron has served as the trusted advisor behind high-performing organizations and private estates. Available globally for operational and human capital leadership.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#inquiry" class="btn-primary">Request Consultation</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-right">
    <img src="profile.png" alt="Sonia J. LeBron" />
  </div>
</section>

<section id="inquiry" class="inquiry-section">
  <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <div class="section-tag" style="justify-content: center;">Direct Access</div>
    <h2>Begin a <em>Confidential</em> Conversation</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 1.5rem auto 3rem; line-height: 1.8;">
      To maintain the highest level of discretion, please direct all inquiries regarding family office management, household leadership, or strategic HR consulting via email.
    </p>
    
    <a href="mailto:slebron5809@comcast.net?subject=Private%20Inquiry%20-%20Sonia%20J.%20LeBron" 
       class="btn-primary">
       Send Email Inquiry
    </a>
    
    <p style="margin-top: 2rem; font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--navy); letter-spacing: 0.05em;">
      slebron5809@comcast.net
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="nav-logo" style="color: rgba(250,248,243,0.8);">Sonia J. LeBron</div>
  <div>&copy; 2026 Sonia J. LeBron. All Rights Reserved. Confidentiality Assured.</div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
